WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:18.691
at the TV station was busy.

2
00:00:19.572 --> 00:00:20.852
A woman turned on a camera.

3
00:00:21.993 --> 00:00:23.294
A man carried a microphone.

4
00:00:24.095 --> 00:00:26.456
They were getting ready to film an episode of Mighty Man.

5
00:00:30.239 --> 00:00:30.799
Mighty Man?"

6
00:00:31.179 --> 00:00:31.720
asked someone.

7
00:00:36.216 --> 00:00:39.257
"Here I am," said an actor in a superhero costume.

8
00:00:40.278 --> 00:00:44.239
Suddenly—poof! A man appeared in a puff of smoke.

9
00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:47.621
He had a tall hat and a thin moustache.

10
00:00:48.521 --> 00:00:49.441
He wore a tuxedo.

11
00:00:50.542 --> 00:00:51.822
A monkey sat on his shoulder.

12
00:00:53.563 --> 00:00:54.924
The man had an evil grin.

13
00:00:54.944 --> 00:00:58.305
"There's going to be a new show today!"

14
00:00:58.325 --> 00:01:01.466
"Hurry up!"

15
00:01:01.726 --> 00:01:02.287
said Jack.

16
00:01:03.527 --> 00:01:05.128
"Mighty Man is on in ten minutes!"

17
00:01:06.292 --> 00:01:08.373
Roxy and her friends were on their way to Jack's house.

18
00:01:09.293 --> 00:01:12.435
They were going to watch Mighty Man, a TV show about a superhero.

19
00:01:12.455 --> 00:01:17.076
"I wonder what Mighty Man will do today," said Mara.

20
00:01:17.096 --> 00:01:22.038
"Last week an asteroid was about to crash into Earth," said Jack.

21
00:01:22.058 --> 00:01:25.500
"So today Mighty Man is going to stop it!"

22
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.342
"Mighty Man is so cool," said Mara.

23
00:01:30.362 --> 00:01:33.783
"He's okay," said Terrell.

24
00:01:33.803 --> 00:01:35.944
"But he's not that great."

25
00:01:37.368 --> 00:01:38.749
Jack and Mara were stunned.

26
00:01:38.769 --> 00:01:40.731
"What do you mean?"

27
00:01:41.131 --> 00:01:41.692
asked Jack.

28
00:01:42.973 --> 00:01:43.813
Terrell shrugged.

29
00:01:43.833 --> 00:01:45.995
"Mighty Man isn't real.

30
00:01:46.896 --> 00:01:48.557
He's just a character on a show."

31
00:01:48.577 --> 00:01:51.460
"We know that," said Jack.

32
00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:55.443
"But if he was real, he'd be the best superhero ever."

33
00:01:57.345 --> 00:01:58.125
"No way!"

34
00:01:58.445 --> 00:01:59.086
said Terrell.

35
00:02:00.047 --> 00:02:02.629
"Rocket Girl is much cooler than Mighty Man!

36
00:02:03.109 --> 00:02:03.930
Right, Roxy?"

37
00:02:04.911 --> 00:02:06.052
Everyone looked at Roxy.

38
00:02:07.432 --> 00:02:08.733
"Well?" said Mara.

39
00:02:08.753 --> 00:02:10.714
"What do you think, Roxy?"

40
00:02:11.774 --> 00:02:13.035
Roxy thought for a moment.

41
00:02:13.055 --> 00:02:15.837
"I agree with Terrell," she said.

42
00:02:15.857 --> 00:02:19.539
"Rocket Girl is definitely cooler than Mighty Man.

43
00:02:20.359 --> 00:02:22.500
Mighty Man is kind of silly."

44
00:02:26.822 --> 00:02:29.244
The four friends got to Jack's house and went inside.

45
00:02:32.145 --> 00:02:34.867
Jack grabbed some snacks, and everyone flopped onto the sofa.

46
00:02:35.867 --> 00:02:36.728
Jack turned on the TV.

47
00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:38.865
But Mighty Man wasn't on.

48
00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:42.648
Instead a strange man was on the set of the TV show.

49
00:02:43.649 --> 00:02:45.791
He had a tall hat and a thin moustache.

50
00:02:45.811 --> 00:02:49.594
"Hello, everybody," said the man.

51
00:02:49.614 --> 00:02:52.297
"Mighty Man has been canceled.

52
00:02:52.717 --> 00:02:54.118
I have a new show for you.

53
00:02:55.319 --> 00:02:58.162
It's a magic show, and I'm the star!

54
00:02:59.222 --> 00:03:00.504
I'm going to be famous!"

55
00:03:00.524 --> 00:03:04.447
"Who is that guy?"

56
00:03:04.847 --> 00:03:05.408
asked Terrell.

57
00:03:06.932 --> 00:03:09.795
Roxy couldn't tell her friends, but she knew who the man was.

58
00:03:09.815 --> 00:03:13.238
"That's the evil magician Mr.

59
00:03:13.338 --> 00:03:14.899
Presto!" she thought.

60
00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:17.601
Roxy's watch beeped.

61
00:03:19.263 --> 00:03:21.905
She rushed into Jack's kitchen and pressed a button on the watch.

62
00:03:26.289 --> 00:03:26.929
"Rocket Girl!"

63
00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:28.050
said Mayor Bloom.

64
00:03:29.091 --> 00:03:31.593
"Mr. Presto took over the TV station!"

65
00:03:32.634 --> 00:03:34.316
"I know," Roxy whispered.

66
00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:35.776
"Don't worry.

67
00:03:35.998 --> 00:03:36.805
I'll stop him!"
